        "description": "Stream newly-arrived redacted workspace logs over SSE, filtered by correlation and level. Requires platform.observability.read resolved at the target workspace.\n\nStream endpoint (WebSocket, SSE). Connect via WebSocket upgrade or Accept: text/event-stream.\n\nRequired scopes: platform.observability.read.",
